    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified that the following Orders issued by the Minister in charge of the subject of Finance by virtue of the powers vested in him by the Section 25 read with Section 32 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52), as amended, and published as Excise Notification, were passed by Parliament.",
